'''Mummy''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 6th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.
== Appearance==
The whole knife is tightly wrapped in brown mummy linen, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Mummy Gun (2020)|partner gun]] under the same name.

